            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi <code>change_color</code> pada instance <code>car</code> dan ubah warnanya menjadi \"yellow\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Car\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  manufacturer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ferrari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  model = \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_specs\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.manufacturer)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.model)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"change_color\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, new_color)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.color = new_color\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Color is now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", self.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"car = Car()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(car.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"car.change_color(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"307\" endIndex=\"310\" /><option startIndex=\"310\" endIndex=\"311\" /><option startIndex=\"311\" endIndex=\"323\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Car\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"324\" endIndex=\"332\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"red\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Color is now yellow\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>car</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>change_color</code>, <code>\"yellow\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
